[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 26595.35, "timestamp": "07:23:15", "text": "菠菜的替代品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26597.59, "timestamp": "07:23:17", "text": "我們稱之為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26599.23, "timestamp": "07:23:19", "text": "liata，意思是非常好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26602.548, "timestamp": "07:23:22", "text": "那幾乎是我小時候唯一真正喜歡吃的蔬菜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26605.35, "timestamp": "07:23:25", "text": "然後我們吃了平常吃的土豆和豌豆。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26613.51, "timestamp": "07:23:33", "text": "呃，還有什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26626.788, "timestamp": "07:23:46", "text": "？南瓜是那種葡萄酒之類的東西，還是像個酒罐？  南瓜是一種蔬菜。"}]